{"id":"falaise","lemma":"falaise","pos":"noun","rank":4256,"glosses":["cliff (steep rock face)"],"ipa":"/fa.lɛz/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ea/Fr-falaise.ogg/Fr-falaise.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"falaises"},"formAudio":{"falaises":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/18/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-falaises.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La falaise est presque verticale.","en":"The cliff is almost vertical.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"almost"},{"g":"vertical"}]},{"text":"Je veux plonger de la falaise.","en":"I want to dive off the cliff.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"to dive"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"of the"]]},{"text":"J'ai failli tomber de la falaise.","en":"I almost fell off the cliff.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"bankrupt"},{"g":"to fall"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"of the"]]},{"text":"Il se tenait au bord de la falaise.","en":"He stood on the edge of the cliff.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to have","l":"tenir"},null,null,null,{"g":"the / her"},null],"phrases":[[3,6,"by"]]},{"text":"Un vieux château se tient en haut de la falaise.","en":"An old castle stands on top of the cliff.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/28132","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"old"},{"g":"castle (fortified…"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to have","l":"tenir"},null,null,null,{"g":"the / her"},null],"phrases":[[5,8,"at the top of"]]}]}